{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, no enemies, no fancy graphics \u2013 just achievements. There are 39 chaotic and unpredictable goals waiting to be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might find yourself yelling into a microphone, solving strange puzzles, or teaming up with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some achievements are obvious, while others require creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for speedrunners and players who love getting 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global leaderboard tracks the fastest and most creative ways to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no single path to victory \u2014 experiment, optimize, and find your own route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will take seconds. Others might take hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your brain, your curiosity, and maybe a bit of teamwork to figure things out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416380?t=1756977558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416380?t=1756977558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/a745ca7357782a123a45ce998c4fe06f709db602/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756977558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/a745ca7357782a123a45ce998c4fe06f709db602/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756977558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, no enemies, no fancy graphics \u2013 just achievements. There are 39 chaotic and unpredictable goals waiting to be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might find yourself yelling into a microphone, solving strange puzzles, or teaming up with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some achievements are obvious, while others require creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for speedrunners and players who love getting 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global leaderboard tracks the fastest and most creative ways to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no single path to victory \u2014 experiment, optimize, and find your own route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.poster.avif?t=1756977558\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.webm?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.mp4?t=1756977558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will take seconds. Others might take hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your brain, your curiosity, and maybe a bit of teamwork to figure things out.</p>","developers":["Tent Incident"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/298183aaf0b18fc02c207e2c565814170ad96cdb/header.jpg?t=1756977558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110220,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110220/movie480.mp4?t=1750324983","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110220/movie_max.mp4?t=1750324983"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110220/8002d66cd8226a24dabeb4c2fcaf924ad4bf37d0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750324983","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110220/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750324983","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s